msgid "LS_damageShield/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_damageShield/descr"
msgstr "Grants invulnerability."

msgid "LS_damageShield/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Creates an energy shield that protects your vehicle from any"
" damage except ramming, drowning, and impact for 7 s. Can be used multiple "
"times in a battle. Removed after being used at least once in a battle.<br "
"/><br />Only available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: "
"Operation Pandora</font> event.<br /><br />All unused abilities will be "
"removed and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next "
"update."

msgid "LS_damageShield/name"
msgstr "Energy Shield"

msgid "LS_damageShield/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Creates an energy shield that protects your vehicle from any damage except "
"ramming, drowning, and impact for 7 s."

msgid "LS_damageShield/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_damageShield/short_special"
msgstr "Grants invulnerability."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/descr"
msgstr "Your next successful shot causes double damage."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Your next successful shot causes double damage. Can be used "
"multiple times in a battle. Removed after being used at least once in a "
"battle.<br /><br />Only available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last "
"Stand: Operation Pandora</font> event.<br /><br />All unused abilities will "
"be removed and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next"
" update."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/name"
msgstr "Double Damage"

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/onUse"
msgstr "Your next successful shot causes double damage."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/short_special"
msgstr "Your next successful shot causes double damage."

msgid "LS_fastReload/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_fastReload/descr"
msgstr "Increases rate of fire / reloads magazine."

msgid "LS_fastReload/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Significantly accelerates the loading of a cyclic gun for a "
"period of time or instantly reloads the magazine and accelerates shell "
"loading in it for guns with magazine reloading systems. Can be used multiple"
" times in a battle. Removed after being used at least once in a battle.<br "
"/><br />Only available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: "
"Operation Pandora</font> event.<br /><br />All unused abilities will be "
"removed and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next "
"update."

msgid "LS_fastReload/name"
msgstr "Fast Reload"

msgid "LS_fastReload/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Significantly accelerates the loading of a cyclic gun/shell loading for a "
"period of time or instantly reloads the magazine."

msgid "LS_fastReload/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_fastReload/short_special"
msgstr "Increases rate of fire / reloads magazine."

msgid "LS_invisibility/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_invisibility/descr"
msgstr ""
"Makes your vehicle invisible to enemies, restores hit points, repairs "
"modules, and extinguishes fire."

msgid "LS_invisibility/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Activates stealth making your vehicle invisible to enemies "
"for 10 s. Restores 35 HP per second, instantly repairs modules, extinguishes"
" fire, removes the stun effect, and treats all injured crew members. Causing"
" or receiving damage from an enemy vehicle (by firing, ramming, or using "
"Combat Abilities) will reveal your position immediately. Can be used "
"multiple times in a battle. Removed after being used at least once in a "
"battle.<br /><br />Only available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last "
"Stand: Operation Pandora</font> event.<br /><br />All unused abilities will "
"be removed and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next"
" update."

msgid "LS_invisibility/name"
msgstr "Stealth Heal"

msgid "LS_invisibility/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Activates stealth making your vehicle invisible to enemies for 10 s. "
"Restores 35 HP per second, instantly repairs modules, extinguishes fire, "
"removes the stun effect, and treats all injured crew members. Causing or "
"receiving damage from an enemy vehicle (by firing, ramming, or using Combat "
"Abilities) will reveal your position immediately."

msgid "LS_invisibility/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_invisibility/short_special"
msgstr ""
"Temporarily makes your vehicle invisible to enemies, restores hit points, "
"repairs modules, extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and treats all "
"injured crew members."

